%% HAND-CURATED — sys-04 §8 failover decision tree + §9 retry matrix.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Orchestrator
    participant GoogleLiveFlashPrimary
    participant GoogleLiveFlashFallback
    participant PhraseCache

    Orchestrator->>GoogleLiveFlashPrimary: stream STT/LLM/TTS request
    alt primary_timeout_circuit_opens
        Note over GoogleLiveFlashPrimary: 5 failures in 30s — circuit opens
        GoogleLiveFlashPrimary--xOrchestrator: timeout after 3000ms
        Orchestrator-)Orchestrator: emit tbot-circuit-breaker-event opened
        Orchestrator->>GoogleLiveFlashFallback: retry in fallback region
        GoogleLiveFlashFallback-->>Orchestrator: stream response
    else fallback_provider_unavailable
        Orchestrator->>GoogleLiveFlashFallback: retry in fallback region
        GoogleLiveFlashFallback--xOrchestrator: 5xx
        Orchestrator->>PhraseCache: lookup cached response by intent + content hash
        PhraseCache-->>Orchestrator: cached phrase audio
    else all_providers_failed_use_canned
        Orchestrator->>GoogleLiveFlashFallback: retry
        GoogleLiveFlashFallback--xOrchestrator: error
        Orchestrator->>PhraseCache: lookup
        PhraseCache--xOrchestrator: miss
        Note over Orchestrator: send LLM_TOKEN text frames + ERROR E-RT-212
    else success
        GoogleLiveFlashPrimary-->>Orchestrator: stream STT_FINAL + LLM_TOKEN + TTS_AUDIO
    end
    Note over Orchestrator: half-open after 30s — 5 consecutive successes required to close — automatic failback, no sticky failover
